    "sub_name": "工程測量",
    "sub_ename": "ENGINEERING SURVEYING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要介紹工程測量之基本理論和操作之方法，使學生得到工程測量之基本訓練。課程主要內容包含工程控制網最佳化、工程放樣、路線測量、子午線測定、土方計算以及結構物變形量測等。",
    "describe_eh": "This course mainly introduce the basic principles and operation of engineering surveying to make sure students learned the basic training. The course includes network optimization, construction layout, transit observation, earthwork computation, and construction deformation measurement.",
    "pre_subname": "CE2081測量學、HY2003測量學(一)",
